Want a cool way to bump up charisma?  This has only happened once, in
gnomish mines.  I hit a magic trap.  blind, monsters all around.  Well,
it was in a corridor, and I HAD to go through it. Flash--mon, flash--mon,
flash--mon,.....  you feel charismatic!, you feel charismatic!,... end
